            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.10.15

- Rebuilt the volume HUD around macOS’s compact system-volume proportions.
- Replaced the oversized control surface with a smaller device label, narrow native slider, and restrained mute action.
- Preserves the existing expand and collapse animation.
]]></description>
